     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Homophones",
     "texto": [
      "**Morze** («sea») and **może** («can; maybe») are pronounced the same, but are spelled differently and have different meanings."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Spelling",
     "texto": [
      "In standard pronunciation, **rz** and **ż** usually represent the same sound; **ch** and **h** also sound the same for most speakers. Don't always work out the spelling by ear."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
